Package: sklad
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: pavver <https://github.com/pavver>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libglib2.0-bin, libvulkan1, libwayland-client0, libxkbcommon0, apt, pkexec | policykit-1, xdg-utils
Recommends: mesa-vulkan-drivers
Suggests: flatpak, steam-installer
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://pavver.github.io/sklad/
Description: Catalogue of everything installed, with safe removal
 Sklad lists apt packages, Flatpak apps, Steam games, Rust toolchains,
 Cargo, npm and Python tools and loose files in one list, sorted by last
 launch, and removes each entry through the manager that installed it,
 with the exact command shown before it runs.
